---
/**
 * Thin top scroll-progress bar. Decorative (aria-hidden). The fill element
 * carries [data-scroll-progress]; the shared Layout script writes scaleX(0..1)
 * on scroll (compositor-only). No-JS: the fill stays at scaleX(0), invisible.
 */
---

<div
	class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[var(--z-progress)] h-[3px] bg-transparent"
	aria-hidden="true"
>
	<div
		class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-crimson-bright via-crimson to-gold"
		data-scroll-progress
	>
	</div>
</div>
